<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  AIDIN Hand Gen2 right hand, rooted at right_hand_base_link with relative mesh
  paths, for tools that do not resolve package:// URIs. ROS 2 builds the model
  from xacro/aidin_hand2.urdf.xacro instead.

  Each finger joint4 follows its joint3 through a four-bar linkage that this
  file cannot state: constrain it in your own tool.
-->
